I then went into a huge park.
I really walked for many kilometres.
First I stayed on the wide paths.
There I walked past old palaces.
They look beautiful in the spring light.
I also passed by many statues.
The trees in this park are very tall.
I went for a walk among the tall trees for a long time.
At some point I turned off the main paths.
I went onto small side paths.
There I strolled almost alone.
Only a few people came towards me.
I just kept walking further.
I hiked almost through the whole park.
My legs got a little heavy after a while.
But I did not stop.
I just continued walking through nature.
